From: Simon McVittie <smcv@collabora.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Jan 2019 10:00:10 +0000
Subject: build: Use CODE_COVERAGE_CPPFLAGS

This is part of the documented API of AX_CODE_COVERAGE, although it
isn't amazingly important (all it does is to disable assert() to avoid
assertions being counted as unreached).

Signed-off-by: Simon McVittie <smcv@collabora.com>
Forwarded: https://github.com/flatpak/xdg-dbus-proxy/pull/9
---
 Makefile.am | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Makefile.am b/Makefile.am
index eb81c60..949980d 100644
--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -1,5 +1,8 @@
 include $(top_srcdir)/build-aux/glib-tap.mk
 
+AM_CPPFLAGS = \
+	$(CODE_COVERAGE_CPPFLAGS) \
+	$(NULL)
 AM_CFLAGS = \
 	$(GLIB_CFLAGS) \
 	$(CODE_COVERAGE_CFLAGS) \
